# NOR logic gates (4001)
#
#           +----------4001----------+
# in_01  -1-|>-+---\         ignored-|-14-
#           |  | or |o-+             |
# in_02  -2-|>-+---/   |      /---+-<|-13- in_13
#           |          |  +-o| or |  |
# out_03 -3-|<---------+   |  \---+-<|-12- in_12
#           |              |         |
# out_04 -4-|<---------+  +--------->|-11- out_11
#           |          |             |
# in_05  -5-|>-+---\   |  +--------->|-10- out_10
#           |  | or |o-+  |          |
# in_06  -6-|>-+---/      |   /---+-<|-9-  in_09
#           |             +-o| or |  |
#        -7-|-ignored         \---+-<|-8-  in_08
#           +------------------------+






